  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Nature for Resilient Investments and Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action consists of two components, 1) &#xBF;Scaling up nature-positive investments&#xBF; (EUR 6 million) and 2) &#xBF;Scaling up investments in nature-based solutions &#xBF; Global Gateway NbS-Infrastructure Incubator&#xBF; (EUR 18 523 610).1)Scaling up nature-positive investmentsThe action proposed will complement the action &#xBF;Investments in regional infrastructure&#xBF; (CRIS number: NDICI AFRICA/2021/043-421) adopted as part of the multi-annual Indicative Programme for Sub-Saharan Africa 2021-2027 and for which a contract will be signed with the Agence Fran&#xE7;aise de Developpement (AFD) in 2025.2)Global Gateway NbS-Infrastructure Incubator (&#xBF;the Incubator&#xBF;)This component will facilitate and enhance the delivery of Global Gateway under the green and clean principle and following a 360&#xB0; approach by using nature and natural processes to enhance the cost effectiveness, sustainability and resilience of the European infrastructure offer to our partners.</narrative>
  </description>
